# A39 stage 2: boot TeraDesk via #Z, dump the idle desktop, then double-click
# HARD DISC C (195,35 -- coordinates from measurement-2026-09-19-a39 recon) and
# dump the opened window (info line "... bytes used in ... items").
# Ticks are 200 Hz after the first AES pump of the first EL0 program.
1100 mark A_IDLE_DESKTOP
1200 park
1206 move 300 300
1400 move 195 35
1600 down
1603 up
1608 down
1611 up
2400 mark B_WINDOW_OPEN
3400 mark C_WINDOW_5S
